t;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> &#8212;</b></p></td></tr></table></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Sale of investment property</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On September 29, 2022, the Company sold the Clemson Best Western Hotel Property to an unrelated third party for a sale price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_9_29_2022_To_9_29_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_ClemsonBestWesternHotelPropertyMember_Y9bA1mWV6U-amOSN3HRRhg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfPropertyHeldForSale" scale="0" id="Narr_vnD8TTQu90C7z2ul4WxBgQ">10,015,000</ix:nonFraction>, resulting in a loss on disposal of investment properties of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_ClemsonBestWesternHotelPropertyMember_3D1Kirqzs0KNEEhPgiVaPw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnSalesOfInvestmentRealEstate" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_urASvz0muESSIzn9BLt4PQ">421,096</ix:nonFraction> reported on the Company's consolidated statement of operations for the year ended December 31, 2022. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Company reports properties that have been either previously disposed or that are currently held for sale in continuing operations in the Company's consolidated statements of operations if the disposition, or anticipated disposition, of the assets does not represent a shift in the Company's investment strategy. The Company's sale of the Clemson Best Western Hotel Property does not constitute a change in the Company's investment strategy, which continues to include limited-service hotels as a targeted asset class.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_YwtV0wcenUKl9_b6BjIj4Q" name="mdrr:ScheduleOfOperatingResultsOfRealEstateInvestmentPropertyIncludedInContinuingOperationsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_dFB1gIhj60qI_lSzNnU0ew" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Operating results of the Clemson Best Western Hotel Property which are included in continuing operations, are as follows:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:65.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.27%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:bre