hite-space:nowrap;width:65.33%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Net Loss Attributable to Medalist Common Shareholders</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.27%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.65%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> &#8212;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:15.62%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_ClemsonBestWesternHotelPropertyMember_3D1Kirqzs0KNEEhPgiVaPw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" sign="-" scale="0" id="Tc_8Dz4e7pi9EagJwLeSSzqsQ_15_6">663,713</ix:nonFraction>)</b></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">2022 Property Acquisitions</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On June 13, 2022, the Company completed its acquisition of the Salisbury Marketplace Property, a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_sqft_0_BnkbuxkUKWO12aiwfbbw" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_SalisburyMarketplacePropertyMember_XFIdSGv7W0udwP4hkTG5yg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AreaOfBuilding" scale="0" id="Narr_O5vq8YnNzECmD7gxjYiS7Q">79,732</ix:nonFraction> square foot retail property located in Salisbury, North Carolina, through a wholly owned subsidiary. &#160;The Salisbury Marketplace Property, built in 1986, was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_SalisburyMarketplacePropertyMember_iKQVQinbIk6zOWO46UM1Zg" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AssetAcquisitionLeasedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_sX0y9iNTzk6h9UdNjMXKDg">85.3</ix:nonFraction>% leased as of December&#160;31,&#160;2023, and is anchored by Food Lion, Citi Trends and Family Dollar. &#160;The purchase price for the Salisbury Marketplace Property was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_SalisburyMarketplacePropertyMember_5LreaDuYfEGqaS-fVAxlHQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredExcludingAcquisitionAndClosingCostsTotal" scale="0" id="Narr_XuoRCmFzMEy_honbbOZH-Q">10,025,000</ix:nonFraction> paid through a combination of cash provided by the Company and the incurrence of new mortgage debt. &#160;The Company&#8217;s total investment was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_SalisburyMarketplacePropertyMember_5LreaDuYfEGqaS-fVAxlHQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_VxCkNT5h2UC8DP1lqj_uKQ">10,279,714</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_SalisburyMarketplacePropertyMember_5LreaDuYfEGqaS-fVAxlHQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredTransactionCost" scale="0" id="Narr_NSBhcVUgBEau2r1wqkpikA">254,714</ix:nonFraction> of acquisition and closing costs which were capitalized and added to the tangible assets acquired. &#160;</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_SalisburyMarketplacePropertyMember_B_qFAot88UqUHUljnM_jMg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfRecognizedIdentifiedAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedTableTextBlock" id="Tb_g9u8UwyXpkifcC_19ZNhGA" continuedAt="Tb_g9u8UwyXpkifcC_19ZNhGA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt