in accounts payable and accrued liabilities on the Company&#8217;s consolidated balance sheets. &#160;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">72</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;min-height:10.35pt;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_F5MVHfVFlEmcGpMuY1vP6Q_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The mandatorily redeemable preferred stock was issued at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_7wse7kOL4kOetxcwJueEZw" contextRef="As_Of_2_19_2020_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_OCffP_qeXUq14WbtCmMMBw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_Jzk97BzS30eISq07mBOnSA">23.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_7wse7kOL4kOetxcwJueEZw" contextRef="Duration_2_19_2020_To_2_19_2020_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_WywVQ77VAkyO4C2axe8wgA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:StockIssuedDuringPeriodDiscountPerShareNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_lSG2bR44EEqnnAtphTZkmQ">2.00</ix:nonFraction> per share discount. The total discount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_2_19_2020_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_OCffP_qeXUq14WbtCmMMBw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockDiscountOnShares" scale="0" id="Narr_XOtFe7tPKU-TDzpktjOC4g">400,000</ix:nonFraction> is being amortized over the <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_2_19_2020_To_2_19_2020_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_WywVQ77VAkyO4C2axe8wgA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:PreferredStockDiscountAmortizationPeriod" id="Narr_4bBH7KnF2Ea2RyndzHzF7A">five-year</ix:nonNumeric> life of the shares using the effective interest method. Additionally, the Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_2_19_2020_To_2_19_2020_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_WywVQ77VAkyO4C2axe8wgA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LegalFees" scale="0" id="Narr_R9Xa270vRkq78cFVg_vIfw">739,118</ix:nonFraction> in legal, accounting, other professional fees and underwriting discounts related to this offering. These costs were recorded as deferred financing costs on the accompanying consolidated balance sheets as a direct deduction from the carrying amount of the mandatorily redeemable preferred stock liability and are being amortized using the effective interest method over the term of the agreement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Amortization of the discount and deferred financing costs related to the mandatorily redeemable preferred stock totaling </span><span style="font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_Nq3mcl8X-0il_mVzeoJTOQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AmortizationOfDiscountAndDeferredFinancingCostsOnMandatorilyRedeemablePreferredStock" scale="0" id="Narr_gywH5SLly0yYvSC4zdUQwA">243,054</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">&#160;and&#160;</span><span style="font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_fGkCqfsumUG2p5NGahO3nQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AmortizationOfDiscountAndDeferredFinancingCostsOnMandatorilyRedeemablePreferredStock" scale="0" id="Narr_laOeFfV8qUOLG1DwdWa6fA">222,881</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">&#160;was included in interest expense for the years ended December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, respectively, in the accompany</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">ing consolidated statements of operations. Accumulated amortization of the discount and deferred financing costs was </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_V4ASzpStu02NExIwsrtLow" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AccumulatedAmortizationOfDiscountAndDeferredFinancingCostsOnMandatorilyRedeemablePreferredStock" scale="0" id="Narr_uY2P1056oUCjB2rkHLP-gQ">832,693</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_ScheduleOfSharesSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionBySettlementTermsAxis_us-gaap_CumulativePreferredStockSubjectToMandatoryRedemptionMember_b5wHAzgihUiPjJrplnuvLg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AccumulatedAmortizationOfDiscountAndDeferredFinancingCostsOnMandatorilyRedeemablePreferredStock" scale="0" id="Narr_hq_I2KXcO0a3GxzJdyPCng">589,639</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> as of December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, respectively.</span></p></ix:continuation><a id="_223f25ca_82f7_4da2_98d7_ab140e80d90d"></a><a id="Tc_gdYzpFX9zEa-u3vskGi6cQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_7Jtm7NE6KE-kebyCRSHutA_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_h_kVl_U3bUqIgDrDyqjQOw_2_9"></a><a id="Tc_OnIOXJLioEymOUOgY3Rigg_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_ZX-WPEalTkKxYY0B2z2lMA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_xYYqYfM4UE6791sX31ZchQ_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_f-4lq9Rri0iyAjGPLtcUFA_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_qOkPHmoNT0OPom6ltOr0Aw_3_9"></a><a id="Tc_ZxVYKBnV4EyKAe9izvr8Kg_3_12"></a><a id="Tc_t3YGAHfDCU6Dl4iG4Ql8zA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_GzAWlG4d-EKfRVGHbhjpjw_4_6"></a><a id="Tc_6Rc9yDjqdk23YYVxlxMUtA_4_9"></a><a id="Tc_eRbQJWYB_EqGAO1Usit1BQ_4_12"></a><a id="Tc_RP88ghxAqUiqxXSMEsyFxg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_DAWIKTaJGUOd5avw06Nbiw_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_vbMfAUIWA0aQ70FyWJfVbg_5_6"></a><a id="Tc_2_Ck0qWKlEWblb6x9yPY5A_5_10"></a><a id="Tc_GG_7hDukDU6zUGP_h3JAow_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_rS0pdTFDqUO49xShiCBXPg_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_vvJPiiD6_0uzrtSyl3ZDDA_6_6"></a><a id="Tc_26qZ44w-LEqwJLYKdt_Uhw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_edlK-GmH7EW1NyF6b1rJyw_7_2"></a><a id="Tc_U6vkV6YX002v1cg3yDW32g_7_6"></a><a id="Tc_uViLn51NRkSZCyTId_s5GA_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_51Sc_s3YK0eaNaRslLVZIw_8_2"></a><a id="Tc_7okod7vkd0WqlqS9usoHWg_8_5"></a><a id="Tc_Z0DF4SLFPkSXpGJo3AbG5Q_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_-YscIW_ZjEedPAWs5AraQA_9_2"></a><a id="Tc_4LVsj7hQgkGCrNlukj3mzg_9_6"></a><a id="Tc_7ixka9XkuECGEZiVkobKNQ_10_0"></a><a id="Tc__RryvMhAnUaKg7to5STgkA_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_y5oyTa3dZ0y1aocnxQQRzA_11_9"></a><a id="Tc_MEVLXMsG-06fppFZgFTlvw_11_12"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_YwtV0wcenUKl9_b6BjIj4Q" name="us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock" id