;">thirty-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule. The mortgage loan includes covenants for the Company to maintain a net worth of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_cVHtyC66Xky4OXNIn0_t9Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsNetWorthCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_MSiBy6PVLU-Sep17WM6MRQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_cVHtyC66Xky4OXNIn0_t9Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsNetWorthCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_FTZwRZWvfkGjyGJ03jABlg">13,250,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, excluding the assets and liabilities associated with the Franklin Square Property and for the Company to maintain liquid assets of no less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_cVHtyC66Xky4OXNIn0_t9Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumLiquidAssetsCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_U6wLS3SbSEKKEP7vRQeHPA">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, the Company believes that it is compliant with these covenants. The Company has guaranteed the payment and performance of the obligations of the mortgage loan.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(b)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">As of December 31, 2023, the Company reclassified the mortgage loan for the Hanover Square Property to mortgages payable, net, associated with assets held for sale (see below). &#160;</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(c)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The mortgage loan for the Ashley Plaza Property bears interest at a fixed rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_AshleyPlazaPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_ehBHZGcCPke-JOE6bbJsIA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_nfbgVyOkAUyRjhe7SqM6rQ">3.75</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% and was interest only for the first twelve months. &#160;Beginning on October 1, 2020, the monthly payment became </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_AshleyPlazaPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_ux_cG45pt0KKmIWtYuN-wQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" scale="0" id="Narr_plZ3dhFXp0aLpRvCAtxI7g">52,795</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> for the remaining term of the loan, which includes interest at the fixed rate, and principal, based on a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_AshleyPlazaPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_ux_cG45pt0KKmIWtYuN-wQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr_P9w8wLe8nk-u4hzktgxlSw"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">thirty-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule. Effective on December 26, 2023, the Company assumed certain guaranty obligations under the Ashley Plaza mortgage loan related to the Guaranty Substitution (see below). &#160;These obligations include covenants for the Company to maintain a net worth of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_AshleyPlazaPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_ehBHZGcCPke-JOE6bbJsIA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsNetWorthCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_o0u0Bc_S-0KbIjAZqO-c5A">11,400,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, excluding the liabilities associated with the mortgage loan for the Ashley Plaza Property, and for the Company to maintain liquid assets of no less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_AshleyPlazaPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_ehBHZGcCPke-JOE6bbJsIA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumLiquidAssetsCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_BABeSnWebEyvX71o2oOIwA">1,140,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company believes that it is compliant with these covenants.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(d)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The mortgage loan for the Brookfield Property bears interest at a fixed rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_BrookfieldCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_yTH_AobTu0-G8OO8mzUnng" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_4dLKwV_6HUOr6QLOQOzSBA">3.90</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% and was interest only for the first twelve months. &#160;Beginning on November 1, 2020, the monthly payment became </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_BrookfieldCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_XxZ9AQ3oJ0-iAyY-dNZgjg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" scale="0" id="Narr_Rilmyx3Fv0-IAy5qhCF2Bg">22,876</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> for the remaining term of the loan, which includes interest at the fixed rate, and principal, based on a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_BrookfieldCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_XxZ9AQ3oJ0-iAyY-dNZgjg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr__zJXrmusmU--M_BRjwbwOA"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">thirty-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule. &#160;Effective on December 26, 2023, the Company assumed certain guaranty obligations under the Brookfield Property mortgage loan related to the Guaranty Substitution (see below). &#160;These obligations include covenants for the Company to maintain a net worth of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_BrookfieldCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_yTH_AobTu0-G8OO8mzUnng" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsNetWorthCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_1KW0Pb_kRk-CxjhpZyFQrg">4,850,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, excluding the liabilities associated with the mortgage loan for the Brookfield Property, and for the Company to maintain liquid assets of no less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_BrookfieldCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_yTH_AobTu0-G8OO8mzUnng" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumLiquidAssetsCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_h8nd80b9tEe7dqp2ylEmVQ">485,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company believes that it is compliant with these covenants.</span></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">73</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_xW0xPmvD1US0GsTOuVZrIQ_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_xW0xPmvD1US0GsTOuVZrIQ_cont2"><ix:continuation id="Tb_SC-ahsrM5kOdp3NfX3HOdg_cont1"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(e)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The interest rate for the mortgage loan for the Parkway Property was originally based on ICE LIBOR plus </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_mdrr_IntercontinentalExchangeLondonInterbankOfferedRateIceLiborMember_gzItyklIUEK2d5XQMYdDSQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-4" id="Narr_iofeNiWrk0i2f_HgXu__hA">225</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> basis points, with a minimum rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_mdrr_IntercontinentalExchangeLondonInterbankOfferedRateIceLiborMember_RTYpOmCxokuFe75QPTFyng" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_hxQX5RLQtUudhCcbtOxsYA">2.25</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">%. &#160;After the discontinuation of LIBOR on June 30, 2023, the ICE LIBOR index was replaced by Term SOFR, with an adjusted margin of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrOvernightIndexSwapRateMember_cYP2SkAj302C0ofZ4pBGcQ" decimals="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-4" id="Narr_S6zXEvabOUmckmHHkEjkMQ">236.44</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> basis points. &#160;Under the terms of the mortgage, the interest rate payable each month shall not change by greater than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_bMxbVykn6kaLngZN_A6rQA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentThresholdChangeInInterestPayableDuringSixMonths" scale="-2" id="Narr_40dtHBaQKkSqTVylOgwGbQ">1</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% during any six-month period and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_25mjG2uh_kGF4natD-Twyg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentThresholdChangeInInterestPayableDuringTwelveMonths" scale="-2" id="Narr_XWF6_7iaPE2LvVVhukd5RQ">2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% during any 12-month period. &#160;As of December 31,&#160;2023 and 2022 the rate in effect for the Parkway Property mortgage was </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_bMxbVykn6kaLngZN_A6rQA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateDuringPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_qmrt4K88QEeBL3zaw17lKQ">7.05</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_25mjG2uh_kGF4natD-Twyg" decimals="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateDuringPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_DI5ZeRtoRkeMDKhDoiug8Q">6.37</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">%, respectively. The monthly payment, which varies based on the interest rate in effect each month, includes interest at the variable rate, and principal based on a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_bMxbVykn6kaLngZN_A6rQA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr_BVLr-DTReUW7O0ISuB0UcQ"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">thirty-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule. &#160;The mortgage loan for the Parkway Property includes a covenant to maintain a debt service coverage ratio of </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_OXytCUkgOEWqHij3J7rXoQ" name="mdrr:DebtServiceCoverageRatio" id="Narr_HkGMjxHvdE22T1KRaCTSdw"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">not less than 1.30 to 1.00 on an annual basis</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. &#160;As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, the Company believes that it is compliant with this covenant.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(f)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">On June 13, 2022, the Company entered into a mortgage loan facility with Wells Fargo Bank (the &#8220;Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility&#8221;) in the principal amount of $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_mCz_Cvwu1E6EpWCuCOuv6A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_fzcwjpIUOkuriGlvYUynOg">18,609,500</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. &#160;The proceeds of this mortgage were used to finance the acquisition of the Salisbury Marketplace Property and to refinance the mortgages payable on the Lancer Center Property and the Greenbrier Business Center Property. &#160;The Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility bears interest at a fixed rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_mCz_Cvwu1E6EpWCuCOuv6A" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ph7zxD42WUePi4WwU2KLcQ">4.50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% for a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_Vbg3zvb1vkSp-8nvGgwE4g" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:MaturityTerm" id="Narr_XV3hVlYy70maRL7gk4qRpA"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">five-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> term. &#160;The monthly payment, which includes interest at the fixed rate, and principal, based on a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_Vbg3zvb1vkSp-8nvGgwE4g" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr_HsO9r8jd6EmEOdC7YcvX5A"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">twenty-five-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule, is </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_Vbg3zvb1vkSp-8nvGgwE4g" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" scale="0" id="Narr_bZt3ZHvOFEWnbuNsAcqDfg">103,438</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. &#160;The Company has provided an unconditional guaranty of the payment of and performance under the terms of the Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility. &#160;The Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility credit agreement includes covenants to maintain a debt service coverage ratio of </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_e0etFDRXbUamEttVsawv3w" name="mdrr:DebtServiceCoverageRatio" id="Narr_FNF8Xi7UUkSs7rmzM7Tpqw"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">not less than 1.50 to 1.00</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> on an annual basis, a minimum debt yield of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_mCz_Cvwu1E6EpWCuCOuv6A" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumDebtYieldCovenant" scale="-2" id="Narr_smTreLkt50eEyDblqU8X0Q">9.5</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> on the Salisbury Marketplace Property, the Lancer Center Property and the Greenbrier Business Center Property, and the maintenance of liquid assets of not less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_mCz_Cvwu1E6EpWCuCOuv6A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumLiquidAssetsCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_W0YotBwzxEO4oMxV0vs1_A">1,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company believes that it is compliant with these covenants. &#160;</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 36pt;">The Company refinanced the mortgage loan for the Lancer Center Property, using proceeds from the Wells Fargo Facility. &#160;The Company accounted for this refinancing transaction under debt extinguishment accounting in accordance with ASC 470, and for the year ended December&#160;31,&#160;2022, recorded a loss on extinguishment of debt of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_LancerCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_bEneWcdkDkS4ElugBsrNXw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_5iM4QqDwe0GQ1sUIB5hNJA">113,282</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The original mortgage loan for the Lancer Center Property bore interest at a fixed rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_LancerCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_d4Eso2IXfEm-WrP4XqzU0g" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Ue8yOww_HkyIc8BDEyCWiA">4.00</ix:nonFraction>%. &#160;The monthly payment was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_LancerCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_gfxWQuiA4E-oT72BnAX3CQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" scale="0" id="Narr_boZ6LyKq7kWKhfhPMLiWiw">34,667</ix:nonFraction> which included interest at the fixed rate and principal, based on a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_LancerCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_gfxWQuiA4E-oT72BnAX3CQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr_v2-Rwg5uHkKyya2YVSkGMA">twenty-five-year</ix:nonNumeric> amortization schedule. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_LancerCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_pHlEL3_3gU6c_c_mjzxZDw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_5if6YbN7pUuqeDIFw-pn4Q">No</ix:nonFraction> such loss was recorded during the year ended December&#160;31,&#160;2023.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 36pt;">The Company refinanced the mortgage loan for the Greenbrier Business Center Property, using proceeds from the Wells Fargo Facility. The Company accounted for this refinancing transaction under debt extinguishment accounting in accordance with ASC 470, and for the year ended December&#160;31,&#160;2022, recorded a loss on extinguishment of debt of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_GreenbrierBusinessCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_CPSHV2R1G0uvIrrqAfH_0Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" sign="-" scale="0" id="Narr_ayWnTZKWgEWQIPyp6jnx0w">56,393</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The Company assumed the original mortgage loan for the Greenbrier Business Center Property from the seller. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_GreenbrierBusinessCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_nt0WzlyIuU6-_9rE23Pc6g" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:GainsLossesOnExtinguishmentOfDebt" scale="0" id="Narr_4c0SMnn01ECkaCwkca-j7Q">No</ix:nonFraction> such loss was recorded during the year ended December&#160;31,&#160;2023.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Guaranty Substitution</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"></span><span style="display:inline-block;width:18pt;"></span>Pursuant to the terms of the Termination Agreement, during December 2023 the Company entered into consent agreements with lenders for the Ashley Plaza Property, Brookfield Property, Franklin Square Property and Parkway Property mortgages under which the Company replaced certain guaranty obligations of the Messrs. Messier and Elliott. &#160;Under these agreements, the Company assumed guaranties related to environmental waste and acts of fraud, among others, and consented to certain covenants (discussed above) to maintain minimum net worth and liquidity levels. &#160;For the Franklin Square Property mortgage loan, the termination of the Management Agreement was considered an event of default. &#160;Under the consent agreement for the Franklin Square Property mortgage loan, the lender agreed to waive the event of default in exchange for the payment of a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_tz2cfAB640-NUlUWZxNfqg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LossOnContractTerminationForDefault" scale="0" id="Narr_sx2qJXOfx0OlE7RH8EeMeg">132,500</ix:nonFraction> consent fee, and the Company&#8217;s agreement to fully guaranty the Franklin Square Property mortgage loan. &#160;The $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_tz2cfAB640-NUlUWZxNfqg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LossOnContractTerminationForDefault" scale="0" id="Narr_mIWPN2XRq0-UGg5GusAh8Q">132,500</ix:nonFraction> consent fee is recorded as part of the management restructuring fee on the consolidated statement of operations for the year ended December 31, 2023. &#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_Fh6yyShO2EWZMdZGAezT-g" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:LossOnContractTerminationForDefault" scale="0" id="Narr_KnGxvwDQyUOXuq-P21z42Q">No</ix:nonFraction> such expenses were recorded for the year ended December 31, 2022. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">74</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_fa84b3ac_76ad_4af3_b382_8c23878b8d0f"></a><a id="Tc_-yQA-EUvlkyXt7LxO2QOFA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_HTxC_4vjl0SHUTu8e8AdpA_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_OlQXv9C_OEy63PKwozhlEQ_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_gh3T4sTtGEC5wJV9Q0ecew_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_-ojUMfd55k6xZ7hm9o79oQ_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_FTby_ENTl06SA0HEmsVjwg_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_xsPs4_WK80yofRteXEQ38g_4_6"></a><a id="Tc_vRrUrdm8P0yhadfLpDVOaQ_4_8"></a><a id="Tc_wzvJh8r62EqhARsA-bmAjw_4_11"></a><a id="Tc_W93vw-PYP0uOSNEL7B7eGw_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_t-UAB0j7c0qFkuF2yqlkvA_5_1"></a><a id="Tc_DfwcrSGcHEGibINoiJIaaA_5_5"></a><a id="Tc_eBrPW7NczkGhw7FvcU_DIw_5_6"></a><a id="Tc_HqyjkFbLfkqiROASpwVN-w_5_12"></a><a id="Tc_E4kV2_HlP026-XCt999FQw_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_C0AtYoZreEehLNMwAy2x6g_6_12"></a><a id="Tc_nta-8OVmzEmJG3MlVQQ8rw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_0MAEj5vqCkyzoPv_Jx-BNg_7_8"></a><a id="Tc_tLxQKvErY0KZ0Cw0WNKlSw_7_11"></a><a id="Tc_bUt8-hJy-kiC4cvoRLpqqg_7_12"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_xW0xPmvD1US0GsTOuVZrIQ_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_xW0xPmvD1US0GsTOuVZrIQ_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Mortgages payable, net, associated with assets held for sale</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0p