<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;min-height:10.35pt;"><a id="_b9f25705_b414_4686_b7d4_3093c7c0495c"></a><a id="Tc_9iMjIwdb-ke8BtS_8zZ6DA_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_GwbV51wmH0yb3Q0jFz5bMA_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_ljJSwIcVd0662Np9j8YDeg_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_3aE9B1TXq0SKPlzG-112RQ_1_7"></a><a id="Tc_EJ5jVkKjBkKDeggk8D-G5g_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_w_-rpnG5tEyo0da1hI6KaA_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_SmC7RUw3uUm5UJR-BLwkHw_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_bZBzmKFcZkuXX4rISPjmHQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_Ys4G3zFOdUeocnyRPMTyhA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_HiDVQEE9cUGQPI0hrREL7Q_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_Ez3nUqBqvUeb47Dvpu5oDA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_jfz1g3WY602Kdb0GfrgCWg_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_7uVpF5xJc0GfhyOVheNejw_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_jJobXGik30KEaBeAr_yTlQ_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_VSlvynJNVESNYfLTDBTAow_9_4"></a><a id="Tc_Y_rDpZYBs0W4LnCNyBdyuA_9_7"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_W85xDqEeIEOPYsMhcnt73A_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_W85xDqEeIEOPYsMhcnt73A_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Common Stock Repurchase Plan</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In December 2021, the Board approved a program to purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_PBm2PsfUEkiAJkMHmOVbQg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchaseProgramNumberOfSharesAuthorizedToBeRepurchased" scale="0" id="Narr_AaJNJzP-uEGOdpSn4f3NHw">62,500</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares in the open market, up to a maximum price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_7wse7kOL4kOetxcwJueEZw" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_bdQW1I8N_kWNT_9QRAB89A" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:StockRepurchaseProgramMaximumPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_fAsuART1CUuCgkWFH8mI_w">38.40</ix:nonFraction> per share (the &#8220;Common Stock Repurchase Plan&#8221;). As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company had repurchased <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_R4D-soP0qkuvlNgA_FmGlA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_DpmIX_TCU0KXMou5eTuSXg">33,509</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares in the open market under the Common Stock Repurchase Plan at a total cost of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_R4D-soP0qkuvlNgA_FmGlA" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue" scale="0" id="Narr_hLzpVGNI006gPhArXhkVDg">278,277</ix:nonFraction> at an average price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_7wse7kOL4kOetxcwJueEZw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_jpq-FdgO2EKE5l_l0jflkw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AverageSharePriceForShareRepurchases" scale="0" id="Narr_Yyo4O472IUWWNy4L6iazEA">8.30</ix:nonFraction> per share. &#160;The Company incurred fees of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Dura