auto 0 0;"></div></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">(1)</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">Total cost before transaction fees.</p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On October 18, 2023, the Board approved the repurchase of an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_10_18_2023_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_EFfNSs4jnkGLxNkmesMB9A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:StockRepurchaseProgramNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorizedToBeRepurchased" scale="0" id="Narr_Ob57i0fKn0O6p6ELUiZ7bw">200,000</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares for a maximum price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_7wse7kOL4kOetxcwJueEZw" contextRef="Duration_10_18_2023_To_10_18_2023_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_M9RXgLk86UmpGqtkrl927w" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:StockRepurchaseProgramMaximumPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_VfK5RjSDeUecmQ3L4hl1KA">6.00</ix:nonFraction> per share under the Common Stock Repurchase Plan previously approved by the Board in December 2021. &#160;Following the approval of the increase, the Company may purchase up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_10_18_2023_us-gaap_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_mdrr_CommonStockRepurchasePlanMember_EFfNSs4jnkGLxNkmesMB9A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchaseProgramRemainingNumberOfSharesAuthorizedToBeRepurchased" scale="0" id="Narr_uNX9mSwPD0K4uOeSQd9Jgw">228,991</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares in total under the Common Stock Repurchase Plan. &#160;Shares will be repurchased, if at all, in accordance with all applicable securities laws and regulations, including Rule 10b-18 of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended. The Company&#8217;s decision to repurchase its shares, as well as the timing of such repurchases will depend on a variety of factors that include the ongoing assessment of the Company&#8217;s capital needs, market conditions and the price of the Company&#8217;s common stock and other corporate considerations, all as determined by management. The repurchase program does not obligate the Company to acquire any particular amount of shares, and the repurchase program may be suspended or discontinued at any time at the Company's discretion.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Common Shares and Operating Partnership Units Outstanding</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, respectively, there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_1SUg9TGqOkOPQvpLBH97LQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_Zsee83jH1kCsj0f0_srxHg">2,245,501</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_w1Ex5ncZiUCruOz13M35TQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_Oec3uWyOIU-bmFq4Kz6Kjg">2,246,494</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units outstanding, respectively, with the REIT owning <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_xYo67_W9nUysYVH1s94Odg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_iZYefDaePUCFjMG0ji4Oxw">2,218,810</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_mbbd8nKN50yMihN_phfmyw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_SzvVKPnGwECB4wCTxOggqg">2,219,803</ix:nonFraction> of these Operating Partnership Units, respectively. The remaining <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_OnEqm73whEWmzPh5NtwU5Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_FQwyh-T1xUCyFHf6ilsH3w">26,691</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units are held by noncontrolling, limited partners. &#160;As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, respectively, there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_dei_LegalEntityAxis_mdrr_MedalistDiversifiedRealEstateInvestmentTrustMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_5dxcGRORs0uwehYdBXa_1A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_-0N2BMJflU64RuyHjGBiMA">2,218,810</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_dei_LegalEntityAxis_mdrr_MedalistDiversifiedRealEstateInvestmentTrustMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_MXukZQ8we0iUrq8hDDHu5w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_nsQukjQ1Y0ybfokwC7nr9g">2,219,803</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares of the REIT outstanding, respectively. As of December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022 there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_XVQRHk0FJ0-E4COZXeBlyw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:CommonUnitsEligibleForConversion" scale="0" id="Narr_mrs_zloHzkSb-NqDlS6OJw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_XF9RZXQEEkWi2ADVf_IUag" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:CommonUnitsEligibleForConversion" scale="0" id="Narr_kDBHLjKtGUaISwx-Rcbiww">26,691</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units held by noncontrolling, limited partners that were eligible for conversion to Common Shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">2018 Equity Incentive Plan</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s 2018 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;Equity Incentive Plan&#8221;) was adopted by the Board on July&#160;27, 2018 and approved by the Company&#8217;s shareholders on August&#160;23, 2018. The Equity Incentive Plan permits the grant of stock options, stock appreciation rights, stock awards, performance units, incentive awards and other equity-based awards (including LTIP units of the Company&#8217;s Operating Partnership) to its employees or an affiliate (as defined in the Equity Incentive Plan) of the Company and for up to the greater of (i)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_8_23_2018_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_l3zbg0aLMkeFY7X9T7jZQw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_i94sfEz0UEaIcumnORfH5w">30,000</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares and (ii)&#160;eight&#160;percent (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="Duration_8_23_2018_To_8_23_2018_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_e9Bk1VJcn0-o-0_K0ythgQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:FullyDilutedSharesOfCommonSharesPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_AUAX3FkqC0On4hxdeu-mpg">8</ix:nonFraction>)% of the number of fully diluted shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Shares (taking into account interests in the Operating Partnership that may become convertible into Common Shares).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 2, 2022, the Compensation Committee of the Board (the &#8220;Compensation Committee&#8221;) approved a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_3_2_2022_To_3_2_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_jDROXuXl_EG1Sp-8c__pMA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_GyHtnGLylkqk4N-XDRLKPA">7,500</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_employee_iZEHMrGnokO_CJYS2tgjSQ" contextRef="Duration_3_2_2022_To_3_2_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_jDROXuXl_EG1Sp-8c__pMA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:NumberOfEmployeesWhoReceivedGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_WWglPz_M1EKWExpKhc_U9Q">two</ix:nonFraction> employees of the Manager who also served as directors of the Company, a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_3_2_2022_To_3_2_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementNonemployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_mS3I9JtMmEu-iPUaMB_BVQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_0XHFMzoIrUa9rN3V_2eZEQ">11,250</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to the Company&#8217;s <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_9a253wDdw0eAfZHGW2MO1g" contextRef="Duration_3_2_2022_To_3_2_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_jDROXuXl_EG1Sp-8c__pMA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:NumberOfDirectorsWhoReceivedGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_yXQNZjsMvk2a4LT42GDf6g">three</ix:nonFraction> independent directors, and a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_3_2_2022_To_3_2_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_k-oZpDjlHkKeDewKasKMEQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_GHX8KoQKs0yLEX9LmHRCBQ">7,500</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to the chief financial officer of the Company, under the Equity Incentive Plan. The effective date of the grants was March 2, 2022. The Common Shares granted vested immediately and are unrestricted. However, the Equity Incentive Plan includes other restrictions on the sale of shares issued under the Equity Incentive Plan. Because the Common Shares vested immediately, the fair value of the grants, or $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_3_2_2022_To_3_2_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_S_g-rlg9Sk2XY5Fdorddrw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:FairValueOfGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_PNZiq4Z6skKp228pUccfHg">233,100</ix:nonFraction>, was recorded to share based compensation expense on the Company&#8217;s consolidated statements of operations on the effective date of the grant. The fair value of the grants was determined by the market price of the Company&#8217;s Common Shares on the effective date of the grant.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">80</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_d25033bf_38a3_4d48_9670_2c244653658f"></a><a id="_535a30a3_371b_416b_a11a_ca23b85947ac"></a><a id="Tc_kWu9MIQEGkOmppAHm4DSJg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc__WLyqU8LvUiM27pFzhZMPA_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_8HjXzoPNjkWt1j0ySPQrkw_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_B5WH2oFtikCt4rRWblsAcw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_zNXlRTRCAUKNw-Wawpoe3g_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_Jlp6-flFdEO9MB2pe9KcyQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_jGxBnTuZgkWZD9hs0X3lYw_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_MCRehYNq5EmEMUFSIAQSSQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_g-HgURMvQE2VorbEXBpOnw_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_fHp-Z9PEF0mD_MZ6QTF0Pw_9_2"></a><a id="Tc_iu_UC1EJv0i9KNkhXKaNDQ_9_5"></a><a id="Tc_NlQQrozrokiQDUt9QbaFcQ_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_W0dvXcNdOECjdOpmAABaiA_11_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_W85xDqEeIEOPYsMhcnt73A_cont3" continuedAt="Tb_W85xDqEeIEOPYsMhcnt73A_cont4"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On November 22, 2022, the Compensation Committee approved a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_niPq804TXUCcT8oMW5uWZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_dDzQWiueVUmuolO74b0CwA">9,554</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_employee_iZEHMrGnokO_CJYS2tgjSQ" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_niPq804TXUCcT8oMW5uWZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:NumberOfEmployeesWhoReceivedGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_7LIwFIT7AU280hoUeUPsNg">two</ix:nonFraction> employees of the Manager who also served as directors of the Company, a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementNonemployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_vvFV9g0eCE2HaJeF73LHBQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_ZXt-YQgLm0mTud3iR1Y_MQ">14,331</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to the Company&#8217;s <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_9a253wDdw0eAfZHGW2MO1g" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_niPq804TXUCcT8oMW5uWZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:NumberOfDirectorsWhoReceivedGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_VgOMO9IzP0CEUSkJZTM2mQ">three</ix:nonFraction> independent directors, a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_hZxRcfDapE2CWDUHq3rHgg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_vfdFazkfk0iVWtnYUJ7W7A">9,554</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to the chief financial officer of the Company, and a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_mdrr_ConsultantsMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_jhC38NJV_06TWvtCZVfveg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_9CnsoHbCg0SY6gWrXnXEoQ">6,370</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_IG11B6qZ9Ea8E-R-sNge-Q" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_mdrr_ConsultantsMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_jhC38NJV_06TWvtCZVfveg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:NumberOfConsultants" scale="0" id="Narr_MMKU-QkdgUOm2rbFEiCByQ">two</ix:nonFraction> consultants of the Company, under the Equity Incentive Plan. The effective date of the grants was November 22, 2022. The Common Shares granted vested immediately and are unrestricted. However, the Equity Incentive Plan includes other restrictions on the sale of shares issued under the Equity Incentive Plan. Because the Common Shares vested immediately, the fair value of the grants, or $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_NjDqG3w8AkqOdypjSHcttQ" contextRef="Duration_11_22_2022_To_11_22_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_EPL-a0BdEU6nx6zbm5qpug" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:FairValueOfGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_Zic7GgtXsUW49uUN3aqOTQ">250,000</ix:nonFraction>, was recorded to share based compensation expense on the Company&#8217;s consolidated statements of operations on the effective date of the grant. The fair value of the grants was determined by the market price of the Company&#8217;s Common Shares on the effective date of the grant.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On each January 1 during the term of the Equity Incentive Plan, the maximum number of Common Shares that may be issued under the Equity Incentive Plan will increase by eight percent (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_brWvYcN5b0WeOJWvL5yc7Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:CommonStockIncrementalSharesReservedForFutureIssuancePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr__eY7M3Zzi0WPylQtJpV96g">8</ix:nonFraction>%) of any additional Common Shares or interests in the Operating Partnership issued (i) after the completion date the Company&#8217;s initial registered public offering of Common Shares, in the case of the January 1, 2019 adjustment, or (ii) in the preceding calendar year, in the case of any adjustment subsequent to January 1, 2020. During the year ended December 31, 2023, no shares were issued under the Equity Incentive Plan so no adjustment was made as of January 1, 2024, and the shares available for issuance under the Equity Incentive Plan remained at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_1_1_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_aRdFr_TXbk-NGa4Z6AjTQA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_QsHEAFWvZk2gkfYwg0M3OQ">61,413</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">All Common Share and Operating Partnership Units referenced above have been adjusted to reflect the Reverse Stock Split. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Earnings per share</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Basic earnings per share for the Company&#8217;s Common Shares is calculated by dividing income (loss) from continuing operations, excluding the net income (loss) attributable to noncontrolling interests, by the Company&#8217;s weighted-average number of Common Shares outstanding during the period. Diluted earnings per share is computed by dividing the net income attributable to common shareholders, excluding the net loss attributable to noncontrolling interests, by the weighted average number of Common Shares, including any dilutive shares. As of the years ended December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, respectively, all of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_CRzzpEDw-0miQyL8QWrrmA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_nal0WZhY-E6nbT9b1KXGCg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_w0362txf-kqkocucHoIbqA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_fsHVKJ8E4UivxtI_OyHa5A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_ZRJF9vV36kKerrzwMPbjMg">26,691</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership&#8217;s Units held by noncontrolling, limited partners were eligible to be converted, on a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_CRzzpEDw-0miQyL8QWrrmA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:CommonUnitToCommonStockConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_0oMt0fJNrUmA_YAFkSFwow"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5WsnMWNIh0WitaYuOT8hGw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_fsHVKJ8E4UivxtI_OyHa5A" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:CommonUnitToCommonStockConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_0J__sjn2jUe7iT7l1qB7xg">one</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>-to-one basis, into Common Shares. The Operating Partnership Units and the equivalent Common Shares attributable to the convertible debentures have been excluded from the Company&#8217;s diluted earnings per share calculation because their inclusion would be antidilutive.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Company's loss per common share is determined as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_YwtV0wcenUKl9_b6BjIj4Q" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEarningsPerShareBasicAndDilutedTableTextBlock" id="Tb_2SlPXCHBrkyJKObP8b9JOg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;m