 20, 2022, to shareholders of record on October 17, 2022. &#160;Total dividends and distributions to noncontrolling interests paid during years ended December&#160;31,&#160;2023 and 2022, respectively, are as follows:</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">81</p></div></div>
